{"id":10247,"name":"basculin-white-striped","speciesId":550,"dex":550,"form":"other","generation":5,"types":["water"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":92,"defense":65,"special-attack":80,"special-defense":55,"speed":98},"abilities":[{"name":"rattled","hidden":false},{"name":"adaptability","hidden":false},{"name":"mold-breaker","hidden":true}],"height":10,"weight":180,"baseExp":161,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10247.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10247.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10247.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10247.ogg","genus":"Hostile Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Hostil","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"Red and blue Basculin get along so poorly, they’ll start fighting instantly. These Pokémon are very hostile."},{"version":"white","text":"Red and blue Basculin usually do not get along, but sometimes members of one school mingle with the other’s school."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Red- and blue-striped Basculin are very violent and always fighting. They are also remarkably tasty."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Savage, violent Pokémon, red and blue Basculin are always fighting each other over territory."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"When a school of Basculin appears in a lake, everything else disappears, except for Corphish and Crawdaunt. That’s how violent Basculin are."},{"version":"sword","text":"Anglers love the fight this Pokémon puts up on the hook. And there are always more to catch— many people release them into lakes illicitly."},{"version":"shield","text":"In the past, it often appeared on the dinner table. The meat of red-striped Basculin is on the fatty side, and it’s more popular with the youth."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Though it differs from other